# Wireframe: Project Form

## Purpose & Flow Context

The Project Form allows users to create or edit project details with optimistic updates. Entry: user clicks "Create Project" button or "Edit" on ProjectCard/ProjectDetail. Exit: user saves (optimistic update applied) or cancels (form closes without changes).

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `📎N` | N attachments |
| `💬N` | N comments | `🔗` | Card relationship |
| `👤` | User / mention | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

All interactive screens inherit these. Per-screen specifics noted where they diverge.

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: Form uses 12-column grid, content area spans 8 columns centered.

**App-shell**: Form is within main content area or modal overlay.

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Form Container | Vertical stack of form fields and actions | Max-width 600px, centered |
| Name Field | Label + text input | Required field |
| Description Field | Label + textarea | Optional field |
| Action Bar | Save + Cancel buttons | Sticky bottom in modal, inline in page |

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  |  Project Name                                              |  |
|  |  ________________________________                          |  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  |  Description                                               |  |
|  |  ________________________________                          |  |
|  |  ________________________________                          |  |
|  |  ________________________________                          |  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  |  [Save]  [Cancel]                                          |  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

*Legend: [{Button}] [Input] [Link] [#Heading] [>Dropdown] [Avatar] [Icon]*

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Name Input | Input | Text input for project name, required | Validation error if empty |
| Description Textarea | Textarea | Multi-line text input for description | Optional, can be empty |
| Save Button | Button | Click saves project, closes form | Disabled during save, validates required fields |
| Cancel Button | Button | Click closes form without saving | Discards changes |

## Data Display

This is a form, not a data display screen. Form fields collect:
- Project name (required, max 255 characters)
- Project description (optional, max 2000 characters)

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Name Label | Identifies the name field | "Project Name" |
| Name Placeholder | Suggests input | "Enter project name" |
| Description Label | Identifies the description field | "Description" |
| Description Placeholder | Suggests input | "Enter project description (optional)" |
| Save Button | Submits form | "Save", "Create Project" (on create) |
| Cancel Button | Discards changes | "Cancel" |
| Validation Error | Explains validation failure | "Project name is required" |

## States

### Idle (Default)

Form shows empty fields (create) or populated fields (edit), ready for input.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                            |
|  Project Name                                              |
|  ________________________________                          |
|                                                            |
|  Description                                               |
|  ________________________________                          |
|  ________________________________                          |
|  ________________________________                          |
|                                                            |
|  [Save]  [Cancel]                                          |
|                                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Populated (Edit Mode)

Form shows existing project values, ready for editing.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                            |
|  Project Name                                              |
|  Frontend Redesign                               |  |
|                                                            |
|  Description                                               |
|  Redesign the frontend application with modern             |
|  technologies and improved UX.                             |
|                                                            |
|  [Save]  [Cancel]                                          |
|                                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Optimistic (Saving)

Form shows new values, save button disabled with loading indicator.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                            |
|  Project Name                                              |
|  Frontend Redesign v2                             |  |
|                                                            |
|  Description                                               |
|  Redesign the frontend application with modern             |
|  technologies and improved UX. Updated scope.              |
|                                                            |
|  [⟳ Save]  [Cancel]                                        |
|                                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
  (save button shows spinner, disabled)
```

### Confirmed (Save Complete)

Form closes, parent screen updates with new values.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|  (form closed, parent screen visible with updated project) |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Reverted (Save Failed)

Form reverts to previous values, error toast shown.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                            |
|  Project Name                                              |
|  Frontend Redesign                               |  |
|                                                            |
|  Description                                               |
|  Redesign the frontend application with modern             |
|  technologies and improved UX.                             |
|                                                            |
|  [Save]  [Cancel]                                          |
|                                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
  (values reverted, error toast: "Failed to save project")
```

### Error (Validation Failed)

Form shows validation errors inline.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                            |
|  Project Name                                              |
|  ________________________________                          |
|  ⚠ Project name is required                                |
|                                                            |
|  Description                                               |
|  ________________________________                          |
|  ________________________________                          |
|                                                            |
|  [Save]  [Cancel]                                          |
|                                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Full form layout, max-width 600px, centered |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Same as desktop |
| Mobile (<768px) | Full-width form, stacked fields, save/cancel buttons full-width |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | Form is within main landmark, or dialog if modal |
| Heading order | Form title is h2 |
| Reading / Focus order | Top to bottom: Name → Description → Save → Cancel |
| Accessible names | Name input: aria-label="Project name", Description: aria-label="Project description" |
| Keyboard operability | Tab through fields, Enter submits, Escape cancels (if modal) |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px on inputs and buttons |
| Focus not obscured | Form doesn't obscure focused element |
| Non-color intent | Labels + icons, not just red for errors |
